## ObjectType: Product Lot

Local operational extension; no equivalent GS1 class asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| lot_id | Lot id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | lot_id |
| product_id | Product id | string | Foreign key to products; blank creates no edge. | product_id |
| supplier_id | Supplier id | string | Foreign key to organizations; blank creates no edge. | supplier_id |
| produced_date | Produced date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | produced_date |
| expiry_date | Expiry date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | expiry_date |
| supplier_lot | Supplier lot | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | supplier_lot |

